message: "如果本软件对你的研究有帮助，请按以下格式引用。If you use DBAS in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DBAS: Data Asset Management and Task Orchestration for Scientific Data"
abstract: >-
  DBAS catalogs scattered scientific data (ERA5/NetCDF) across external drives,
  working directories and download folders into a searchable, verifiable,
  traceable and recoverable local catalog database. It provides stable volume
  identity, incremental scanning, metadata indexing, integrity verification,
  online backup, task orchestration with resumable execution, CDS download
  management, and a Zarr array layer whose chunking strategy is derived from
  the query pattern rather than copied from public datasets. Source volumes
  remain strictly read-only; array-layer stores are registered back into the
  catalog with a manifest-level hash as bit-level evidence.
type: software
